<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Angel</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">NewDad</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">MADRA</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">1kiw6IXeTauPy3L964yxoZ</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.494" end="00:15.875">You're sweet, but I'm sick</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.875" end="00:19.688">I hurt myself for kicks</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.688" end="00:21.736">I'm lost, but you're found</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.736" end="00:28.115">Both feet firmly on the ground</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.115" end="00:33.123">And I'm so high but still so low</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.123" end="00:36.573">I think I'm losing my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.573" end="00:38.513">You're an angel</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.513" end="00:41.231">I'm just trying to be like you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.231" end="00:44.598">Even if it's painful</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.598" end="00:48.124">You can swim around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.124" end="00:53.569">But I don't want you to drown inside me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.569" end="01:01.569">It's not fair to be your responsibility</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.782" end="01:05.089">You're kind, but I'm not</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.089" end="01:10.095">It seems that I forgot how to care</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.095" end="01:17.356">About anything but my own despair</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.356" end="01:20.177">And you have a good heart</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.177" end="01:22.305">But I'm sure mine's stopped</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.305" end="01:25.361">And it won't restart</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.361" end="01:27.671">I think it's broken</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.671" end="01:33.764">So you can't own it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.764" end="01:37.384">You can swim around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.384" end="01:42.771">But I don't want you to drown inside me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.771" end="01:50.771">It's not fair to be your responsibility</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.451" end="02:42.982">You can swim around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.982" end="02:48.396">But I don't want you to drown inside me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.396" end="02:52.396">It's not fair to be your responsibility</p></div></body></tt>